Risks Related to Owning Our Common Stock
Numerous factors could result in substantial volatility in the trading price of our stock.
During the year ended December 31, 2016, the price per share of our common stock on the NASDAQ Global Select Market has ranged from a high of
$55.35 to a low of $10.80. We have several stockholders,
